        },
        "description": "A high ranking sweeper (hitman) in Big Daddy&#039;s Millenion organization. Bear and Big Daddy have been friends for many years, and he has Daddy&#039;s complete trust. He quickly sees Brandon&#039;s potential as a sweeper, and takes Brandon under his wing to be trained. The only thing he cares about more than Millenion is his beloved daughter, Sherry.",
